{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1432,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8054b12ab6d22046eb80402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是让我察觉何谓自由的春风──\r\n只要是和你一起，\r\n我这阵风就能吹到任何地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf77aeaa57f73bf01f53f036d8559bb3856d0074038722a7c346acf38cbd1dc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ded82448838778373496f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ee1516a63193eff02c54e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46be5a6e0b6eab6778c8db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风是无形且自由的存在……\r\n同样都喜欢风的我们，\r\n或许有些相似也说不定呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac4713d58294d393583627c30a0270fd0c379f01a2dfc41d1dca688362aff3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eb2bfda3eba0ad54ed6bb56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也有必须携手才能吹起的风……\r\n我衷心期待……\r\n由你吹起的风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc39c5e7866239814f0bb3df70b85b8ba1b76b477b9bfe2ab10243283cc8944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffcc268585e9d8b76c5f7909",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向刚吹起的祥风发誓，\r\n并由衷地祈愿……\r\n希望它能守护我们的旅途……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a84ccb36b39751e60fbaae12db76280098e06ecd86f01322f497952caab8c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d504157ea17c41b491514d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把我、不倒翁和领带都喜欢的\r\n无花果加在巧克力里了。\r\n晚点再送给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1157460d5d01df6d39ca45b6733eaa3f0e3bbba16cbf09d5ce75e7daa00b8b2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af57033da916193b7e8b948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼……我听说，今天是\r\n传递心意的日子。所以把心意\r\n寄托在风中……你，有感受到吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e7d3bf8e7ceb2ce2542786f7215abcae0928d9ff4b62f7ace52e04648102a46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad28edc84a287d31889a9028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了竹叶随着凉风摇摆，\r\n窸窸窣窣地……随着心愿，\r\n摇摆、哼唱的季节呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "849c0fc68d2ccfc431a67a45335e02a9b75157b84e7ec2fe3aa95ba29e87f178",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd61dce7acf46b131897b19e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉鬼怪与恶作剧妖精，\r\n都在风中起舞呢……呵呵，\r\n在万圣节，随着秋风而来的访客……",
      "source_fingerprint": "50ec6595b8a72197b4d0345f468f647ea3ef680277bb1bdea207025ae4d844c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564072c311482a3b534a447e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一阵仙风造访了城镇……\r\n那位服装如火，胡须如云的\r\n可爱人士，是在工作吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca57a98b707bf58146c5205d519575cee3121c14e22ac77f8f53fca8c7becbfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ed2d68ebc5238ad0de6fe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都彷佛置身暖阳之中……\r\n如此圣夜，连寒气都和缓下来了呢。\r\n我们要不要也出去看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "efaeca0b338ae9297c61e20bbf8804029ba582b383707c5e0bdb86c31e83c3a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72d615d549dede21fc4597a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c803c8e3b1b2693e5c6c2969ec676de27951038c55759291e07cb4952fe3caab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5abd03424aa0216df5d4cc63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得这一年的风如何呢？\r\n无论是龙卷风或徐风，\r\n希望都能成为明年的顺风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b424692b8ccd27097f15eab4712b6a90c10b1b2eaf0422801ebec428dc06f1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806741136bb67c350c3b27a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在暖风的吹拂之下，才有现在的我。\r\n我要为今天这个特别的日子\r\n献上祝福与感谢……祝你生日快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d84f3b5f628245cd21816f071b92d92aec5f5683b95b068b10f816c3ebb5537",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ae0fd89d80b4f6cb5343ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，我有准备礼物。\r\n是我喜欢的森林里的泉水。\r\n……如果你喜欢，我再带你过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4b559ce6e1cec9ff057c93995917f04e2df92ccb1eb3ac6d28d36c9fba88e91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01dec5b8e1c6a23837fa6eec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是微风诞生，以成为鲜明的风\r\n为目标开始吹拂的日子……\r\n直到成为风暴的那一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d223cb86ef503e41fa78622006a3630358b6eca9dcd41e0f2db2c11dce56b8c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85397ebaea9bc3e620297d14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要替我庆生？哎呀……呵呵，\r\n请等我一下，我想把今天，\r\n以及接下来要吹起的风牢记在心里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68daccad192c18279d1ad2c7a8b9bfb8ce5b7d025c4d1ae07a4ea468b46aa655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a91bfa36bf546f04eb68a115",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告。\r\n确认一下风儿捎来的消息吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69c4c29e7848e10befe73557dd296b32492ad36de98920e372d88ecd089bfc17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41007e8a2011bc1602aab4fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物。\r\n呵呵，是谁送的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9efa6a31231c58b5381fe99bba18e50526fed08e3b2b3a51cf15231a7d61bad3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1168556ed915c29c7b9ebddc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成了。\r\n好像能够领取奖励喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d30c04e2ca7d26be82d8fcc5ea2715d1868203c05961f4356dd083ed8fe171",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c760e49adc6bb9094b975cab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像快要办活动了。\r\n一起等待顺风吹起吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c39f043c3f39a2498806e53c735ed4827964fa8ea9d7ea00ad398e73527b60ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e165a60bccb3f2fee4e447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不晓得在活动中\r\n能遇到什么样的风？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ffc83a584f13475cc06063124b9d6229ef35f1ae6f1e9edc116b216c007f4b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:088201163cc7c3947ec4b656",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要再吹得更强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fae59adc75e5f0e6622b88b8bcb38f3d1306794a62b7fb04090c75acefcf0ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a2f2ef49f637ec53a6a9457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级好像提升了。\r\n不去查看一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "695381f5e89c2d76269bcc9b62cd290495d0fb281277f7980a4be6b634596d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3204979426135ee35b9c046c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花朵胸针是母亲送的。\r\n它从出生起就陪伴在我身旁，\r\n与我共同分享着喜悦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1b63f29019b4d77693d1241d888aaa544939c5c45b3a536700fcf2c8618bc68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72dd7017e23195ca25ef6da4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这枚花朵胸针总能吸引朋友们驻足。\r\n身为瓢虫的星星先生是这里的常客呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d48bb629042382ec22d22baa44d6735ae27ae0959e4039e8a138f0a20b3010b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcc4fe989cbd05bea699abe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不怎么看手机。\r\n那些通知……让人有点不舒畅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce9ed118d667d106c74e8839c36b8b90eae23c044edbf0c543c697d5d9637ed9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b89c303fab3f8bd873714f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平手了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd970f84d5214f61a9caa920a294685057c39c38a518d0b88dce068bfef17d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4906ca70d0469c7b601ba73d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祥风吹拂，获得胜利了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e19f25d9ca3cfa54c132743af02c6833eebe92731dd85d25f21477cbf1f597",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c408a3c0c4ae0ce0c41c5e33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要再吹得更强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fae59adc75e5f0e6622b88b8bcb38f3d1306794a62b7fb04090c75acefcf0ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89e7b7fb073619537836acb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平手了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd970f84d5214f61a9caa920a294685057c39c38a518d0b88dce068bfef17d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3c37a2aef784d6c79d1485",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新了高分纪录。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbf72e6ca6be76291e776aeaf979177cb07623fa8acd888f83a6a4645ec87da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058a706003bddd76012f8ee7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，一起掀起一阵风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d9b358f4b8d271e8a521936544367f1fcf213ffe6bc845020a1b3aa509faf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aae609ec4f066455dbac85d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79b4d7520322abdbdf19d29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要训练了吗？\r\n今天会吹起什么样的风呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51ed07ce9010fd4b072a9202f069f8eb3f5da8798707b6c6e13a7b0ed4bcee86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7781aa9215a7a77ccc74095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还记得那道在回忆中\r\n吹拂的风吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc76051e20b04370e0206eb32d9a3a635578164dd6c1fcedbf8ed6633672cb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bdc66e3a1c42c82295f5db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参赛啊。\r\n一起去见跑得飞快的台风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2b2186e22ec6c7978b1c2da4aa1996814e215106797e95b28455a7acf2333b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f4845c4f77b98532f8758c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宛如风一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac1d78539db1b887991f286367b7a3ac219fd76f23e9f8aa651c0abfc4ae3a19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cefeab1af9466a2f516c456d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风姿飒爽",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ac3b3becee3ac276ed87f297b56d0668e3c475d89473dad1533cf8e778a560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c1fea8014f42b02230ae8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c7a1545caab78e214cb54e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "温暖的风吹了过来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e62c6d5d1c2490096be3ca6b1ba09438b040742ef4c4fe1642f20d829e578ff8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:061a7211a6490fc2dcef21bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:405a4fd1cd945976b9fc9955",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿祥风守护你……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a862c2af57053fbe2e8b99ec6c04532494f1ddf5351cf45b55707d54946b7d3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:723c40175aef1df754855fcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec510aa97d376867ea1dd11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe9b8a6562528c71dac2f35e4bb3503757fd80fd15a323c0f3842922f08e2da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160637b0ec948880d28bf975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然夹到这么多……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce6b7d1f07fa1d0d7e669689a4cfeabac1951dd3a4ac2850fd448f0aa4eac32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e0606fa36ea588b1b5eaea4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很棒的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a870929512634fb0d9e6ddcc51f89adb3399d2605cf0d5af7e5fd96b1a7b5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:966adc0174b5b083c3b91bba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风总有一天会吹起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ffeda9ea7f73f89723d1d4f9e1e730bb7f637829d6920a631746c24cf39add2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4764dbd20b367d8ca4cf9d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然夹到这么多……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce6b7d1f07fa1d0d7e669689a4cfeabac1951dd3a4ac2850fd448f0aa4eac32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ea1919b4e113e7c9ab3a9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很棒的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a870929512634fb0d9e6ddcc51f89adb3399d2605cf0d5af7e5fd96b1a7b5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e0c1dd553db5095f81f71e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ffd86181f99bb201430319f3ea81b2a0a385cf1b40520738cae2644fb61703d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:943c499e4395cbae50110e77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a58d5198cd20d6397e8f79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1c01d7b1adf80928cc7797eda36b12fe66fb19184015b4f47aaa311bf0e066",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c1ca0301c37fbef079a6e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春风吹拂……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85d620b3ce48088ce2b4eaca39b8aaabb75bc1d68768e45a327432e0ee1815bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d39cbeb8ed604df8d2511d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感情真好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11091d8e49a4eaeb412309174a3fa3ec86ad684fb5e5d8082d8bc2651daec63e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c9dcff1a0348d33a4360ee9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，大丰收呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf14f9574b626875fa29e09794b4775875ab15236d2e2f2e274417f728f57cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f39fd6cb9cfccf6b22ffc09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa590602b03384649277b084cd36d881d4f24707abf056fd0a939443d6e5c4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01e2db52b2456238ad01ae32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻轻地……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8384550c41e539b4a5bf03f4ce75beaa85c2ff9c1afc980e3e1b8ea2be3f03bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b389d7b0bd8d20dbd37722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb75f8d097324489df9101b9fb1301ac4112567bf0af3df0f690cd98a27eee1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5eff79073da65872257b5f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d0eeceded72eace8823cc24b753a0a3007c8ea0e0a4fc8073e9cf559b5eb03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4658fb51210c53d35be96add",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遗憾……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b90d4c62e74958085df917f698ab583a79d74bee83b9ff2b37beab23e083308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90cbfa31bb7398914b6d6e43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像可以获得这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f3db9b1bfa701a79f152d5b5d9b1f5510b217b5b2af606bac9bade790c9e61f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f476406f0f02dddca2a81a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～唉……彷佛陷入了泥泞当中。\r\n这样下去，要想成为风……实在……",
      "source_fingerprint": "963805990f885731013d83416629d13ff25bf5c13cf188f098cb1e7a1278bdbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0d6613805db2a4834115fd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚好沉重……实在称不上顺风。\r\n感觉、有点难受……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9615e0da48c4c2c6a00c43ea90a06faeef098576d0ac511aaa8a57f6468e7fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d385672a43bbdd68c71ee7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……风在我的心里吹拂，\r\n宛如雨后的光风……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eff31c667c35bdb3d620adf599bcea2b864e58a30eaca075dceea5ea72ce58d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee3be81b15865b928e238352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宛如随着海风扬帆的船只。\r\n青空万里无云，心中无边无际。\r\n来，让我们一口气吹向远方吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0c6b8aec5aa8ee5b47c2eed9eb81b16163fce1d87526724ae3e289ec021f24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cbd716b5a1e9b8032a2e985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……这杯茶的味道纯粹又柔和，\r\n果然是阵凉风。感觉我现在，\r\n能以畅快的心情奔向任何地方……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82536eeeae7da126270dd8e9b54cb4db4daf89c3d4dd845469e9b4e51b4512cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4505bf5a29fa9e37572ca0ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小鸟们看起来好舒服……\r\n我也要轻快地随风前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42178331b4cda2e4d25391d82ed07f18744c6681e2e444f21baab0d74ae4fc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4032e5f27708dc2284aff92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以跟平常一样的呼吸，\r\n置身于跟平常一样的风中……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2bd489a3ac147fcf3778d45bdd62d54356db46b6477bc4d0fff9f47bc80d37e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2086f914f88954138bbecebe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既非风暴亦非无风，\r\n微风……没错，这就是平常的我。\r\n所以，请表现得跟平常一样吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a8c29ab0dba5cae5255a7fc01bc3dce5b43535ed7971a3f496b370434468bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21c87d425059771d3bdc4df0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在，还不太适合起跑……\r\n看来只能等待春风……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebd55bf4a8ca6f6be8cfab50decb7466946a813c0b06613bf1c8fd171e7752de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b18b6e0f90175a221b923389",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "牡丹……花林糖……盐豆……\r\n啊，抱歉，我有些心不在焉了。\r\n我刚刚在替小鸟们取名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e0b581de58d51cc45e91d963a1503fcf0c66c60f9c871dff8345a6a68c99fdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:576000d2aca88bd856e43de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……对不起，\r\n我内心的风向……唉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "97a4eee475266dca2727e0e3416589e1043960bf27b40358bcff8df1a2d24390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1a21582fc3893c11fa0cc65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……云看起来好轻盈……\r\n待在高空感觉很舒适……\r\n我明明也想变得跟它一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac322d83c9e0cab29e723bdb13799f455edb22cc6fabc318ecdca25458a80a45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64a26645529198a5590751c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……又要参赛吗？\r\n我是不介意，但好像有点太频繁了。\r\n是遇到了事让你心生焦躁了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cdbbc361d90290997db7f1e4e1f60bbf71272f6ed7dd824f647ea517d1b2904",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dddd1443209f4373ca6c0891",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使继续下去，\r\n也无法感受到舒服的风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf88bb5ea6657b172aa2a9447759f7a4f26e8942776e0ca9804f58a6249d9d68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce81fa43dd87e309b08a1e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的脚已经做好准备，无论对手是\r\n风暴或龙卷风我都奉陪。\r\n我会轻快又激烈地击败对方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec28d8f350d45754aa4ed0391ca414ae465a71e03cc28d4e4104b116f52aa955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83eb5ae7f811300a121671a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天有应援团来呢。\r\n你看，树上有好多……呵呵，\r\n我越来越有干劲了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff2786f0a120eed46c6b781e6240ebf87deb5024d6ca05fbcbacbc3158b1e07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:798d257a127506f4c0e19e47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚感觉好轻……呼～\r\n好了，我们出发吧，\r\n去吹起一阵令人难忘的烈风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "252cb172505899416361b25ee6409267866d26c90b3f3933bde2192569ef48a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20025"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
